{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不只想靠近、被同样珍惜，也想把积攒的关心给对方，看看两个人能过上怎样的日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"同样珍惜\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再为想被珍惜自责，欢喜把他整个人卷了进去。\",\n      \"key\": \"整个人卷进去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他觉得有许多爱可给，许多真情值得珍惜，一时像是想要的都已经有了。可对方没给新保证，他仍盼对方选择自己。\",\n      \"key\": \"想要的都已经有了\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他一时顾不上以后，只想让这阵欢喜多留一会儿，等它稍退，尚未得到回应的期待又回到心里。\",\n      \"key\": \"欢喜多留一会儿\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R53\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"精简\",\n      \"why\": \"删去与不再自责意思相近的旧日难堪退下，以及与整个人被欢喜卷入意思重叠的顾不上得失。保留不再自责和沉浸于欢喜这两个不同的心理事实。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "67bc13d3-c163-4580-9584-2ab23e5ca7b4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T224928843622Z", "elapsed_seconds": 162.593, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:52:11.448972+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_